==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>.
*2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The 9th Angel (Enemy)|The 9th Angel]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**4 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

